  "text": "今天学会了先挡后打。"
 },
 "fort.inn.1-3.2": {
  "role": "luban",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "下一回，我带盾牌来！"
 },
 "fort.inn.1-6.1": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "鲁班按哪路，就先防哪路。"
 },
 "fort.inn.1-6.2": {
  "role": "luban",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "下一回，我派一大群！"
 },
 "fort.inn.1-9.1": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "铜不怕火，可怕聚起来的阳光。"
 },
 "fort.inn.1-9.2": {
  "role": "luban",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "我的铜犀冲车，可没这么好拆！"
 },
 "fort.inn.1-11.1": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "第一卷推演完了！"
 },
 "fort.inn.1-11.2": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "宋城修好了一大半。"
 },
 "fort.inn.2-3.1": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "风能帮我们，也能帮火。"
 },
 "fort.inn.2-3.2": {
  "role": "luban",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "下回我放烟，看你怎么吹！"
 },
 "fort.inn.2-6.1": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "云梯再高，钩拒一拉就倒。"
 },
 "fort.inn.2-6.2": {
  "role": "luban",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "钩拒还是我发明的呢！"
 },
 "fort.inn.2-9.1": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "夜里的考验，你都守住了。"
 },
 "fort.inn.2-9.2": {
  "role": "luban",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "天亮前，我还有最后一招！"
 },
 "fort.inn.2-11.1": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "天亮了，郢都就在前面。"
 },
 "fort.inn.2-11.2": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "回家讲给爸爸听吧。"
 },
 "fort.inn.stop": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "sub",
  "text": "今天就到这里，好不好？"
 },
 "fort.ask.1-1": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：连弩车是怎么拆掉木甲兵的？"
 },
 "fort.ask.1-2": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：为什么先种禾田？"
 },
 "fort.ask.1-3": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：木垒为什么要放在连弩车前面？"
 },
 "fort.ask.1-4": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：盾挡住了箭，挡得住从天上落下的石头吗？"
 },
 "fort.ask.1-5": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：冲车为什么要先跑起来才撞得狠？"
 },
 "fort.ask.1-6": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：鲁班的手按住了哪两路？你提前做了什么？"
 },
 "fort.ask.1-7": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：一箭只能拆一只蚂蚁，一罐火油呢？"
 },
 "fort.ask.1-8": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：礌石为什么要等它们挤在一起再砸？"
 },
 "fort.ask.1-9": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：火油罐为什么烧不动铜甲力士？"
 },
 "fort.ask.1-10": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：你为什么带了这几张牒？"
 },
 "fort.ask.1-11": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：铜犀缩进壳里时，什么能把壳敲裂？"
 },
 "fort.ask.2-1": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：粮仓要等一会儿才出粮，为什么还值得先建？"
 },
 "fort.ask.2-2": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：木鹊飞过了连弩车，为什么转射机打得到它？"
 },
 "fort.ask.2-3": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：风箱吹不动谁？为什么？"
 },
 "fort.ask.2-4": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：烟里看不见，籍车为什么还能打中？"
 },
 "fort.ask.2-5": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：雾里看不见，你怎么知道每路都要守？"
 },
 "fort.ask.2-6": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：云梯压住的是哪一台？"
 },
 "fort.ask.2-7": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：牒片送来时，你是怎么决定放哪儿的？"
 },
 "fort.ask.2-8": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：为什么先拆鼓车？"
 },
 "fort.ask.2-9": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：风箱和火油罐放在同一路，会发生什么？"
 },
 "fort.ask.2-10": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：天亮前和天亮后，你的打法有什么不一样？"
 },
 "fort.ask.2-11": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：木鸢什么时候最好打？"
 },
 "fort.ask.x.1": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：陆战棋里，有没有“擒贼先擒王”？"
 },
 "fort.ask.x.2": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：推箱子的时候，你会不会先想好再推？"
 },
 "fort.ask.x.3": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "讲给爸爸听：下棋时你先保护什么？像不像保护粮仓？"
 },
 "fort.repair.1-1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "城门换上了新门闩。"
 },
 "fort.repair.1-2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "第一块粟田发芽了。"
 },
 "fort.repair.1-3": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "东边的城墙补好了一段。"
 },
 "fort.repair.1-4": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "城楼的木梯修好了。"
 },
 "fort.repair.1-5": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "护城的小桥铺上了木板。"
 },
 "fort.repair.1-6": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "水井装上了辘轳。"
 },
 "fort.repair.1-7": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "第二块粟田长高了。"
 },
 "fort.repair.1-8": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "西边的城墙补齐了。"
 },
 "fort.repair.1-9": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "铁匠铺的炉子点着了。"
 },
 "fort.repair.1-10": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "孩子们有了秋千。"
 },
 "fort.repair.1-11": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "铜犀折成的犁，犁开了第三块田。"
 },
 "fort.repair.2-1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "城里点起了第一盏灯笼。"
 },
 "fort.repair.2-2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "粟田边立起了稻草人。"
 },
 "fort.repair.2-3": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "磨坊装上了风车。"
 },
 "fort.repair.2-4": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "烟囱冒出了炊烟。"
 },
 "fort.repair.2-5": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "雾散了，城头挂起了风铃。"
 },
 "fort.repair.2-6": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "城墙加了一层垛口。"
 },
 "fort.repair.2-7": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "驿站的马车修好了。"
 },
 "fort.repair.2-8": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "城楼挂上了报时的大鼓。"
 },
 "fort.repair.2-9": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "粮仓装满了。"
 },
 "fort.repair.2-10": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "太阳从城后升起来了。"
 },
 "fort.repair.2-11": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "talk",
  "text": "木鸢折成的风筝，挂在城楼上。"
 },
 "fort.alm.shooter.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "连弩车：一次能装好多支箭的大弩车。"
 },
 "fort.alm.shooter.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "弓弦拉得越紧，箭飞得越远。"
 },
 "fort.alm.farm.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "禾田：种下粟，就会长出粮。"
 },
 "fort.alm.farm.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "庄稼要晒太阳，夜里长得慢。"
 },
 "fort.alm.wall.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "木垒：用木头和土垒起来的墙。"
 },
 "fort.alm.wall.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "先挡住，后面的车才能慢慢打。"
 },
 "fort.alm.lobber.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "籍车：把石头抛过城墙的投石车。"
 },
 "fort.alm.lobber.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "杠杆：短的一头一压，长的一头就甩出去。"
 },
 "fort.alm.spikes.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "铁蒺藜：撒在地上的四角铁刺。"
 },
 "fort.alm.spikes.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "四个尖角，怎么扔都有一个尖朝上。"
 },
 "fort.alm.pit.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "陷坑：提前挖好、盖上草的坑。"
 },
 "fort.alm.pit.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "机关一踩就掉下去，被收走了。"
 },
 "fort.alm.burner.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "火油罐：装着火油的陶罐。"
 },
 "fort.alm.burner.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "木头会烧，青铜不会烧。同一把火，要看材料。"
 },
 "fort.alm.strike.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "礌石：守城时从城上推下的大石头。"
 },
 "fort.alm.strike.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "石头越重，砸下来越有力。"
 },
 "fort.alm.beam.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "阳燧：青铜做的凹面镜。"
 },
 "fort.alm.beam.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "凹面镜把阳光聚到一点，那一点会变得很热。"
 },
 "fort.alm.bank.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "粮仓：存粮的大仓库。"
 },
 "fort.alm.bank.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "先花粮建仓，以后一大包一大包地来。"
 },
 "fort.alm.radial.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "转射机：能转圈的弩机。"
 },
 "fort.alm.radial.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "前后左右、天上飞的，都打得到。"
 },
 "fort.alm.gust.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "橐，就是风箱：一拉一推，风就吹出去。"
 },
 "fort.alm.gust.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "风能吹走烟，也能让火烧得更旺。"
 },
 "fort.alm.hook.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "钩拒：一头是钩子，一头是推杆。"
 },
 "fort.alm.hook.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "鲁班为楚国船战做了钩拒；墨子说：我的钩拒是爱和尊敬，比它还厉害。"
 },
 "fort.alm.walker.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "木甲兵：会走路的木头人。"
 },
 "fort.alm.walker.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "会走路的木头人，是古人的想象。"
 },
 "fort.alm.shielder.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "盾甲兵：举着大木盾的木甲兵。"
 },
 "fort.alm.shielder.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "盾挡得住正面，挡不住头顶。"
 },
 "fort.alm.ram.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "冲车：用来撞城门的车。"
 },
 "fort.alm.ram.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "跑得越久，撞得越狠，这叫动量。"
 },
 "fort.alm.ant.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "蚁傅：像蚂蚁一样一拥而上。"
 },
 "fort.alm.ant.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "古书里真有这一招，画成小木蚁是游戏的想象。"
 },
 "fort.alm.brute.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "铜甲力士：穿着青铜甲的大力士。"
 },
 "fort.alm.brute.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "铜不怕火；重的东西，风吹不动。"
 },
 "fort.alm.flyer.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "木鹊：传说鲁班做过会飞的木鸟。"
 },
 "fort.alm.flyer.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "传说它飞上天，三天都没有落下来。"
 },
 "fort.alm.smoker.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "烟车：会放烟的车。"
 },
 "fort.alm.smoker.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "烟挡住眼睛，可挡不住从天上落下的石头。"
 },
 "fort.alm.ladder.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "云梯车：架上城墙的高梯子。"
 },
 "fort.alm.ladder.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "鲁班为楚王造过云梯，这是古书里写的。"
 },
 "fort.alm.drummer.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "鼓车：载着大鼓的车。"
 },
 "fort.alm.drummer.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "古时候打仗击鼓前进，鼓声让人跟着节奏走。"
 },
 "fort.alm.rhino.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "铜犀冲车：外壳是青铜的大冲车。"
 },
 "fort.alm.rhino.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "它后来变成了一把犁，帮宋城翻地。"
 },
 "fort.alm.owl.1": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "夜枭木鸢：夜里飞的大木鸟。"
 },
 "fort.alm.owl.2": {
  "role": "narrator",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "天一亮它就停不住了，后来变成了一只风筝。"
 },
 "fort.alm.walker.fear": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "木甲兵谁都怕，连弩车最省粮。"
 },
 "fort.alm.shielder.fear": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "盾挡得住箭，挡不住从天上落下的石头。"
 },
 "fort.alm.ram.fear": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "冲车要跑起来才撞得狠，蒺藜让它跑不起来。"
 },
 "fort.alm.ant.fear": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "一箭一只太慢了，一罐火油一大片。"
 },
 "fort.alm.brute.fear": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "铜不怕火。重石和聚起来的阳光才对付得了它。"
 },
 "fort.alm.flyer.fear": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "飞在天上的，转射机打得到；风箱能把它吹下来。"
 },
 "fort.alm.smoker.fear": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "烟里看不见。吹散它，或者用不用看的籍车。"
 },
 "fort.alm.ladder.fear": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "梯子一架起来，后面三台都被压住。钩拒把梯子拉倒。"
 },
 "fort.alm.drummer.fear": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "鼓一响，旁边的机关都变快。先拆鼓车。"
 },
 "fort.jn.econ": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "兵马未动，粮草先行：先把粮准备好。"
 },
 "fort.jn.invest": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
  "text": "磨刀不误砍柴工：先花一点，以后得更多。"
 },
 "fort.jn.counter": {
  "role": "dad",
  "kind": "card",
